":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、お母さんは\n「やっぱり割れた~！でも型が悪かったよ！笑」って言われました。。(ToT)\n厳しいよぅ~お母さん  (´д｀|||)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが写メ撮ってたら入ってきたよ♪可愛い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘーイ今回の取り扱い説明書メンバーは〜〜〜〜川後ひなちゃ〜んっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁさぁそれではさっそくやりましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/25/6160418/0002.g